OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fshowers at first, but these will
OL,7,Fbecome more isolated this evening and
OL,8,Ftonight with some clear spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping, but turning cloudier again
OL,10,Fby morning with further showers. Windy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FMostly cloudy with showers or
OL,13,Flonger spells of rain, some heavy.
OL,14,FBrighter intervals possible at times
OL,15,Fand turning drier by evening. Fresh to
OL,16,Fstrong westerly winds. On the cool
OL,17,Fside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
