OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FBright
OL,6,Fon Wednesday with some sunny spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping. Rain spreading from the
OL,8,Fwest on Thursday. Then brighter again
OL,9,Fon Friday with some sunshine.
